  "goodToKnow": "Die Höchstgeschwindigkeit is maximum speed or, with zulässig, the speed limit. In Germany, the default limits are 50 km/h in towns and 100 km/h on country roads; many motorway stretches have no general limit, only a recommended Richtgeschwindigkeit of 130 km/h. A general Tempolimit is a long-running political debate. The ICE reaches up to 300 km/h. Plural: die Höchstgeschwindigkeiten."
